## Verification

Each action already verifies installation by running:

```bash
{{ $cli.Binary }} --version
```

For smoke testing, `actions/{{ $install.DirectoryName }}` is the simplest end-to-end check. For deeper coverage, call a subcommand action with real command inputs.
